  "title": "LIS3DH - HP not working",
  "content": "<p>Hello,<br />I tried to get the HP properly working for hours now, but I get zeros on all axes every third output.<br />What ist wrong? I tried a lot of different setup variation buts always with similar result.<br />When disabling FDS (HP function), there are no zeros in the data stream.<br />In this example I shaked the sensor.</p><pre><code class=\"language-ini\">##########################<br />WHO_AM_I: 0x33<br />LIS3DH found.<br />--- Register-Verification ---<br />TEMP_CFG   (0x1F) = 0x00<br />CTRL_REG1  (0x20) = 0x2F<br />CTRL_REG2  (0x21) = 0x08<br />CTRL_REG3  (0x22) = 0x00<br />CTRL_REG4  (0x23) = 0x80<br />CTRL_REG5  (0x24) = 0x00<br />CTRL_REG6  (0x25) = 0x00<br />REFERENCE  (0x26) = 0x00<br />FIFO_CTRL  (0x2E) = 0x00<br />INT1_CFG   (0x30) = 0x00<br />INT1_THS   (0x32) = 0x00<br />INT1_DUR   (0x33) = 0x00<br />INT2_CFG   (0x34) = 0x00<br />INT2_THS   (0x36) = 0x00<br />INT2_DUR   (0x37) = 0x00<br />CLICK_CFG  (0x38) = 0x00<br />CLICK_THS  (0x3A) = 0x00<br />TIME_LIMIT (0x3B) = 0x00<br />TIME_LAT   (0x3C) = 0x00<br />TIME_WIN   (0x3D) = 0x00<br />ACT_THS    (0x3E) = 0x00<br />ACT_DUR    (0x3F) = 0x00<br />--- Configuration finished ---<br />   ms;      X;      Y;      Z;INT1<br />   56;    184;     16;   -208;   0<br />  147;      0;      0;      0;   0<br />  244;    508;   -364;    228;   0<br />  343;    144;    -64;    -48;   0<br />  440;      0;      0;      0;   0<br />  538;    132;    -48;   -340;   0<br />  635;   -120;    -48;   -208;   0<br />  733;      0;      0;      0;   0<br />  831;   -328;     28;   -228;   0<br />  928;   -180;    -76;    180;   0<br /> 1027;      0;      0;      0;   0<br /> 1124;     -8;    304;    168;   0<br /> 1221;    208;    300;   -164;   0<br /> 1319;      0;      0;      0;   0<br /> 1417;    232;    -56;    128;   0<br /> 1515;    460;    -32;   -172;   0<br /> 1612;      0;      0;      0;   0<br /> 1711;   -116;     28;    176;   0<br /> 1808;   -100;    168;   -208;   0<br /> 1905;      0